Report which file is playing and what the loudness setting does to it.

librespot knows which file Spotify sends for each song (Ogg Vorbis 320 kbps, 160, MP3...) and how much it
raises or lowers the song for loudness normalisation, but it doesn't say so anywhere Cadenza can read.
Two log lines say it, each starting "Cadenza:" and naming the song, which Cadenza reads for the signal path
panel on the EQ page. Nothing about how the music plays changes. librespot.sh applies this file.

